{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.98,"lines":[{"text":"Intro]","t":19.18,"e":19.38,"w":[["Intro",19.18,19.38]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"J'ai grandi là où la méchanceté a des visages d'amis,","t":19.48,"e":22.9,"w":[["J'ai",19.48,19.62],["grandi",19.66,20.04],["là",20.1,20.24],["où",20.3,20.44],["la",20.5,20.64],["méchanceté",20.72,21.32],["a",21.4,21.5],["des",21.56,21.72],["visages",21.78,22.34],["d'amis",22.38,22.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Où pour manger le soir, on sacrifiait nos nuits.","t":24.72,"e":28.04,"w":[["Où",24.72,24.82],["pour",24.9,25.06],["manger",25.14,25.92],["le",26,26.08],["soir",26.18,26.58],["on",26.64,26.72],["sacrifiait",26.78,27.38],["nos",27.44,27.6],["nuits",27.68,28.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La rue, c’est pas un jeu, c’est une jungle sans pitié,","t":29.56,"e":33.46,"w":[["La",29.56,29.66],["rue",29.76,29.9],["c’est",29.96,30.12],["pas",30.2,30.34],["un",30.42,30.54],["jeu",30.62,30.76],["c’est",31.64,31.8],["une",31.88,32.02],["jungle",32.08,32.38],["sans",32.48,32.68],["pitié",32.76,33.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai vu des frères tomber pour des histoires de monnaie.","t":34.58,"e":38.62,"w":[["J’ai",34.58,34.76],["vu",34.82,34.96],["des",35,35.16],["frères",35.2,35.42],["tomber",35.46,35.98],["pour",36.72,36.88],["des",36.96,37.14],["histoires",37.18,37.54],["de",37.58,37.76],["monnaie",37.84,38.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils voulaient me voir au sol, le cœur rempli de venin,","t":39.76,"e":42.46,"w":[["Ils",39.76,39.86],["voulaient",39.92,40.22],["me",40.24,40.28],["voir",40.32,40.52],["au",40.54,40.62],["sol",40.72,40.96],["le",40.98,41.1],["cœur",41.16,41.36],["rempli",41.38,41.76],["de",41.82,41.94],["venin",42.04,42.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils parlaient sur mon dos, mais je traçais mon chemin.","t":44.8,"e":47.6,"w":[["Ils",44.8,44.92],["parlaient",44.98,45.32],["sur",45.4,45.54],["mon",45.6,45.74],["dos",45.82,46.14],["mais",46.24,46.34],["je",46.36,46.4],["traçais",46.44,46.84],["mon",46.88,47],["chemin",47.04,47.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tristesse en bandoulière, mélancolie dans le regard,","t":49.6,"e":53.32,"w":[["Tristesse",49.6,50.04],["en",50.1,50.2],["bandoulière",50.26,51.22],["mélancolie",51.56,52.32],["dans",52.38,52.54],["le",52.6,52.72],["regard",52.8,53.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai appris que la loyauté se compte sur les doigts, c’est tard.","t":54.46,"e":59.58,"w":[["J’ai",54.46,54.68],["appris",54.8,55.06],["que",55.1,55.26],["la",55.32,55.46],["loyauté",55.52,56.26],["se",57,57.14],["compte",57.22,57.4],["sur",57.42,57.58],["les",57.64,57.78],["doigts",57.84,58.08],["c’est",58.26,58.42],["tard",59.38,59.58]],"ok":0.92},{"text":"J’ai bara fort, personne n'a vu mes nuits blanches,","t":60.34,"e":64.16,"w":[["J’ai",60.34,60.56],["bara",60.62,60.94],["fort",61.04,61.34],["personne",62.3,62.68],["n'a",62.72,62.88],["vu",62.92,63.08],["mes",63.14,63.3],["nuits",63.34,63.5],["blanches",63.56,64.16]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La pression sur les épaules, même quand je voulais que tout penche.","t":64.64,"e":69.24,"w":[["La",64.64,64.76],["pression",64.84,65.4],["sur",65.48,65.64],["les",65.7,65.9],["épaules",66,66.5],["même",67.36,67.52],["quand",67.56,67.72],["je",67.78,67.92],["voulais",67.98,68.34],["que",68.38,68.58],["tout",68.42,68.58],["penche",68.66,69.24]],"ok":0.92},{"text":"Le chemin est rocailleux, semé d'envie et de haine,","t":69.7,"e":74.3,"w":[["Le",69.7,69.82],["chemin",69.86,70.5],["est",70.58,70.7],["rocailleux",70.76,71.38],["semé",71.82,72.4],["d'envie",72.46,73.44],["et",73.46,73.46],["de",73.52,73.68],["haine",73.74,74.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais j’ai traversé le feu pour enfin briser mes chaînes.","t":74.58,"e":79.48,"w":[["Mais",74.58,74.72],["j’ai",74.74,74.92],["traversé",74.98,75.98],["le",76.04,76.18],["feu",76.26,76.44],["pour",76.9,77.28],["enfin",77.32,77.88],["briser",77.92,78.52],["mes",78.58,78.72],["chaînes",78.8,79.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’est le prix du succès, le poids de la réussite,","t":80.02,"e":84.44,"w":[["C’est",80.02,80.2],["le",80.26,80.38],["prix",80.44,80.84],["du",80.92,81.02],["succès",81.1,81.52],["le",82.36,82.48],["poids",82.56,82.76],["de",82.82,82.94],["la",83,83.16],["réussite",83.22,84.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La rue m'a formé, j'ai couru quand ils voulaient que je prenne la fuite.","t":85.56,"e":89.42,"w":[["La",85.56,85.7],["rue",85.78,85.92],["m'a",85.96,86.1],["formé",86.18,86.54],["j'ai",86.58,86.76],["couru",86.82,87.18],["quand",87.22,87.38],["ils",87.48,87.6],["voulaient",87.66,88],["que",88.04,88.12],["je",88.16,88.22],["prenne",88.26,88.48],["la",88.56,88.74],["fuite",88.88,89.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le soleil se lève, mais je n'ai jamais vu l'aube,","t":90.62,"e":92.9,"w":[["Le",90.62,90.72],["soleil",90.82,91.16],["se",91.22,91.32],["lève",91.46,91.64],["mais",91.68,91.78],["je",91.8,91.84],["n'ai",91.88,92.02],["jamais",92.08,92.46],["vu",92.54,92.68],["l'aube",92.74,92.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai bossé dans l'ombre, loin de la gloire et des robes.","t":93.12,"e":95.66,"w":[["J'ai",93.12,93.28],["bossé",93.36,93.72],["dans",93.78,93.92],["l'ombre",93.96,94.2],["loin",94.2,94.32],["de",94.36,94.4],["la",94.44,94.54],["gloire",94.6,94.86],["et",94.9,95],["des",95.06,95.2],["robes",95.28,95.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Bara fort, sans répit, les mains calleuses, le dos courbé,","t":95.78,"e":99.34,"w":[["Bara",95.78,95.98],["fort",95.9,96.04],["sans",96.1,96.26],["répit",96.32,96.78],["les",97.16,97.28],["mains",97.36,97.52],["calleuses",97.58,98],["le",98.04,98.16],["dos",98.22,98.38],["courbé",98.44,99.34]],"ok":0.9},{"text":"J’ai essuyé mes larmes quand le monde voulait me voir tomber.","t":100.08,"e":104.4,"w":[["J’ai",100.08,100.3],["essuyé",100.42,101.3],["mes",101.38,101.52],["larmes",101.62,102.18],["quand",102.26,102.4],["le",102.46,102.56],["monde",102.64,102.84],["voulait",102.88,103.2],["me",103.26,103.4],["voir",103.48,103.68],["tomber",103.74,104.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les trahisons m'ont appris à marcher seul dans le noir,","t":105,"e":109.52,"w":[["Les",105,105.12],["trahisons",105.18,105.96],["m'ont",106.04,106.26],["appris",106.54,106.88],["à",106.98,107.04],["marcher",107.12,107.84],["seul",107.94,108.5],["dans",108.58,108.76],["le",108.82,109],["noir",109.18,109.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mon ambition, c’est le miroir de tout mon désespoir.","t":110.08,"e":114.6,"w":[["Mon",110.08,110.24],["ambition",110.32,110.98],["c’est",111.1,111.3],["le",111.36,111.64],["miroir",111.72,112.16],["de",112.62,112.74],["tout",113.02,113.2],["mon",113.44,113.6],["désespoir",113.66,114.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd'hui, quand ils me voient, ils parlent de chance,","t":115.18,"e":119.96,"w":[["Aujourd'hui",115.18,115.78],["quand",115.96,116.18],["ils",116.22,116.54],["me",116.6,116.74],["voient",116.78,117.08],["ils",118.36,118.64],["parlent",118.7,119.08],["de",119.14,119.24],["chance",119.32,119.96]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils savent pas que j’ai combattu pour cette putain de danse !","t":120.22,"e":126.06,"w":[["Ils",120.22,120.3],["savent",120.38,120.56],["pas",120.62,120.92],["que",120.92,121],["j’ai",121.02,121.2],["combattu",121.28,122.14],["pour",123.16,123.3],["cette",123.38,123.72],["putain",123.8,124.24],["de",124.32,124.36],["danse",124.44,126.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Derrière chaque sourire, il y a une cicatrice qui brûle,","t":126.1,"e":129.46,"w":[["Derrière",126.1,126.46],["chaque",126.5,126.7],["sourire",126.78,127.24],["il",127.28,127.4],["y",127.44,127.46],["a",127.48,127.54],["une",127.62,127.74],["cicatrice",127.8,128.64],["qui",128.66,128.82],["brûle",128.88,129.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La méchanceté des hommes, c’est ce qui me stimule.","t":131.2,"e":134.54,"w":[["La",131.2,131.32],["méchanceté",131.4,132.4],["des",132.48,132.68],["hommes",132.7,132.98],["c’est",133.06,133.18],["ce",133.2,133.26],["qui",133.3,133.44],["me",133.5,133.58],["stimule",133.66,134.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai pas besoin de leur respect, j’ai mon propre respect,","t":135.36,"e":139.9,"w":[["J’ai",135.36,135.5],["pas",135.58,135.74],["besoin",135.8,136.16],["de",136.22,136.34],["leur",136.4,136.68],["respect",136.7,137.48],["j’ai",138.54,138.7],["mon",138.76,138.9],["propre",138.96,139.24],["respect",139.26,139.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai payé le prix fort, j'ai plus rien à regretter.","t":140.66,"e":145.08,"w":[["J’ai",140.66,140.82],["payé",140.92,141.48],["le",141.56,141.7],["prix",141.76,142.02],["fort",142.16,142.54],["j'ai",143.18,143.36],["plus",143.42,143.58],["rien",143.62,143.82],["à",143.92,144],["regretter",144.06,145.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai bara fort, personne n'a vu mes nuits blanches,","t":146.56,"e":150.3,"w":[["J’ai",146.56,146.76],["bara",146.82,147.12],["fort",147.26,147.54],["personne",148.52,148.88],["n'a",148.92,149.06],["vu",149.12,149.28],["mes",149.34,149.48],["nuits",149.56,149.7],["blanches",149.76,150.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La pression sur les épaules, même quand je voulais que tout penche.","t":150.82,"e":155.38,"w":[["La",150.82,150.96],["pression",151,151.6],["sur",151.68,151.86],["les",151.9,152.1],["épaules",152.2,152.68],["même",153.56,153.72],["quand",153.76,153.92],["je",153.98,154.12],["voulais",154.18,154.56],["que",154.59,154.79],["tout",154.62,154.78],["penche",154.86,155.38]],"ok":0.92},{"text":"Le chemin est rocailleux, semé d'envie et de haine,","t":155.9,"e":160.34,"w":[["Le",155.9,156.02],["chemin",156.06,156.7],["est",156.78,156.88],["rocailleux",156.96,157.58],["semé",158.02,158.6],["d'envie",158.66,159.64],["et",159.66,159.66],["de",159.74,159.86],["haine",159.98,160.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais j’ai traversé le feu pour enfin briser mes chaînes.","t":160.76,"e":165.44,"w":[["Mais",160.76,160.9],["j’ai",160.94,161.1],["traversé",161.18,162.16],["le",162.22,162.34],["feu",162.44,162.66],["pour",163.1,163.46],["enfin",163.54,164.06],["briser",164.12,164.7],["mes",164.78,164.9],["chaînes",165,165.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’est le prix du succès, le poids de la réussite,","t":166.26,"e":170.64,"w":[["C’est",166.26,166.42],["le",166.48,166.58],["prix",166.64,167.04],["du",167.1,167.22],["succès",167.3,167.74],["le",168.56,168.68],["poids",168.76,168.96],["de",169.02,169.12],["la",169.2,169.34],["réussite",169.42,170.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La rue m'a formé, j'ai couru quand ils voulaient que je prenne la fuite.","t":171.74,"e":175.66,"w":[["La",171.74,171.88],["rue",171.96,172.12],["m'a",172.16,172.3],["formé",172.38,172.74],["j'ai",172.8,172.96],["couru",173.02,173.38],["quand",173.42,173.58],["ils",173.68,173.8],["voulaient",173.86,174.2],["que",174.24,174.32],["je",174.36,174.42],["prenne",174.46,174.68],["la",174.74,174.92],["fuite",175.08,175.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La rue… la méchanceté… mon travail…","t":177.26,"e":182.72,"w":[["La",177.26,177.4],["rue",177.48,177.74],["la",179.52,179.58],["méchanceté",179.64,180.26],["mon",182.08,182.22],["travail",182.26,182.72]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C'est ça mon histoire.","t":184.3,"e":185.24,"w":[["C'est",184.3,184.42],["ça",184.5,184.62],["mon",184.66,184.78],["histoire",184.82,185.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On est arrivés, mais on n'oublie pas d'où on vient.","t":186.14,"e":189.92,"w":[["On",186.14,186.22],["est",186.26,186.34],["arrivés",186.38,186.92],["mais",187.81,188.01],["on",188.7,188.78],["n'oublie",188.8,189.06],["pas",189.16,189.3],["d'où",189.36,189.48],["on",189.52,189.58],["vient",189.64,189.92]],"ok":0.9},{"text":"Oben… (Le Bara paye, ça c'est la vérité).","t":192.12,"e":197.68,"w":[["Oben",192.12,192.32],["Le",194.32,194.4],["Bara",194.54,194.84],["paye",195.02,195.36],["ça",196.66,196.78],["c'est",196.86,196.94],["la",196.98,197.08],["vérité",197.14,197.68]],"ok":0.88}]}